    "statementHTML": "<div class=\"statement-body\">\n<div class=\"statement-section statement-goal\">\n   <h2><span class=\"icon icon-goal\">&nbsp;</span><span>Goal </span></h2>\n   <span class=\"question-statement\">Your little brother spent all afternoon lining up dominoes, and now it's time for the big push!<br><br>The row is described by a string <var>S</var>. Each . is an empty cell, and each digit <var>h</var> is a domino of height <var>h</var>.<br><br>You push the first domino to the right. A falling domino of height <var>h</var> at position <var>i</var> hits every cell from <var>i</var> + 1 to <var>i</var> + <var>h</var>, and every domino it hits falls too, continuing the chain.<br><br>How many dominoes are <strong>still standing</strong> at the end?<br><br>Example: 2.1..3.1<br>The domino at position 0 (height 2) hits cells 1 and 2, knocking down the domino at position 2. That one (height 1) only reaches cell 3, which is empty, so the chain stops. The dominoes at positions 5 and 7 stay standing, so the answer is 2.</span>\n</div>\n<div class=\"statement-section statement-protocol\">\n   <div class=\"blk\">\n      <div class=\"title\">Input</div>\n      <div class=\"question-statement-input\">A single line containing the string <var>S</var>.</div>\n   </div>\n   <div class=\"blk\">\n      <div class=\"title\">Output</div>\n      <div class=\"question-statement-output\">The number of dominoes still standing.</div>\n   </div>\n   <div class=\"blk\">\n      <div class=\"title\">Constraints</div>\n      <div class=\"question-statement-constraints\">1 &le; length of <var>S</var> &le; 100<br><var>S</var> contains only . and the digits 1 to 9.<br>The first character of <var>S</var> is a digit.</div>\n   </div>\n   <div class=\"blk\">\n      <div class=\"title\">Example</div>\n      <div class=\"statement-inout\">\n         <div class=\"statement-inout-in\">\n            <div class=\"title\">Input</div>\n            <pre class=\"question-statement-example-in\">2.1..3.1</pre>\n         </div>\n         <div class=\"statement-inout-out\">\n            <div class=\"title\">Output</div>\n            <pre class=\"question-statement-example-out\">2</pre>\n         </div>\n      </div>\n   </div>\n</div>"
